description:
Create database table for player game state:

File: priv/repo/migrations/TIMESTAMP_create_player_game_states.exs
File: lib/exmud/demo_game/player_game_state.ex

Schema fields:
- player_id (references players)
- inventory: Exmud.Ecto.Term, default: []
- equipment: Exmud.Ecto.Term, default: %{weapon: nil, armor: nil, accessory: nil}
- quests: Exmud.Ecto.Term, default: %{}
- flags: Exmud.Ecto.Term, default: %{}
- current_room_id: binary_id
- stats: Exmud.Ecto.Term, default: %{str: 10, dex: 10, sta: 10, level: 1, xp: 0}
- health: %{current: 100, max: 100}

Add context functions: get_state/1, update_state/2, create_state/1
